<title>AUSTRIA: Austria sets 15 bln ATS 6.25 pct 30-yr bond - OEKB.</title>
<headline>Austria sets 15 bln ATS 6.25 pct 30-yr bond - OEKB.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by Austria's Kontrollbank, the government's financing agent, on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    ISSUER:	Republic of Austria</p>
<p>ISSUE PRICE:99.45 pct</p>
<p>AMOUNT:15 bln ATS</p>
<p>COUPON:6.25 pct</p>
<p>MAX YIELD:6.455 pct</p>
<p>MATURITY:July 15, 2027</p>
<p>PERCENTAGE OF BIDS FILLED:39.378 pct</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom +431 53112 253</p>
</text>
